From 7b4c004531b015be7dc1e44a79fac986c927ad22 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 08:13:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Modernize the old flat pill buttons app-wide (Atgal,
 Atsijungti, etc.)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Every 'Atgal' back button and secondary header action (Darbo laikas,
Įprasti, Atsijungti/Išeiti, and similar) used a flat, borderless
rgba(255,255,255,0.2)/0.12 fill with a plain 10px radius — dating
from before the recent design pass. Swapped in a soft 1px border,
slightly higher radius (12px) and lighter fill to match the glass
aesthetic introduced by the tab bar and package/dashboard cards,
across both admin and client screens. 26 buttons across 16 files;
verified none of the confirmed-dead-code files (FoodSearch.js,
RecipeSuggestion.js) were touched.
---
 src/AdminPanel.js         |  8 ++++----
 src/BookingAdmin.js       | 10 +++++-----
 src/BookingClient.js      |  4 ++--
 src/ClientInfo.js         |  2 +-
 src/ClientMeasurements.js |  2 +-
 src/ClientStats.js        |  2 +-
 src/ClientView.js         |  4 ++--
 src/LiveTraining.js       |  2 +-
 src/PackageAdmin.js       |  2 +-
 src/ProgressCompare.js    |  2 +-
 src/ProgressPhotos.js     |  2 +-
 src/TrainerStats.js       |  2 +-
 src/TrainingPackages.js   |  2 +-
 src/WorkoutPlanBuilder.js |  2 +-
 src/WorkoutPresets.js     |  4 ++--
 src/WorkoutView.js        |  2 +-
 16 files changed, 26 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)

